SUMMARY:Deadline: DOMA Initiatives x British Council: Venice Biennale Fello
 wship 2027 (Malaysia\, GBP 5\,050)
DESCRIPTION:DOMA Initiatives\, in partnership with the British Council\, no
 minates one Malaysia-based fellow for the British Council Venice Fellowshi
 p Programme at the 2027 Venice Biennale (62nd International Art Exhibition
 ).\n\nOrganisation: DOMA Initiatives\, in partnership with the British Cou
 ncil\nLocation: Venice\, Italy (British Pavilion\, 62nd International Art 
 Exhibition). Only for early-career professionals based in Malaysia.\nAward
 : GBP 5\,050 fellowship grant covering travel\, accommodation in Venice\, 
 visa processing and daily living expenses. No separate artist fee or honor
 arium beyond this grant. One fellowship place. No application fee mentione
 d.\nDuration: 1 month in Venice between May and November 2027\, plus 15 ho
 urs of online pre-fellowship training in March-April 2027\n\nMore: https:/
 /www.domainitiatives.org/venice2027?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&
 utm_medium=referral
